<title>CHINA: TENNIS-SHANGHAI OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SHANGHAI OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results on Friday</p>
<p>in the Shanghai Open men's tennis tournament (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) beat Jerome Golmard (France) 6-2 3-6</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Leander Paes (India) beat 4-Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 6-3 2-6 6-3</p>
<p>Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Gerard Solves (France) 6-7</p>
<p>(4-7) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>8-Alexander Volkov (Russia) beat Doug Flach (U.S.) 6-4 4-6 6-2</p>
</text>
